            "EpisodeMasterId": 141241,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 21,
            "SpeakerName": "心菜",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "……嗯。/n小时候看了天狼星的舞台以后，就一直很向往。",
